sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant BAR as SearchBar
    participant VM as SearchViewModel
    participant UC as SearchProductsUseCase
    participant REPO as SearchRepository
    participant API as ProductSearchApi
    User->>BAR: types head
    BAR->>VM: onQueryChanged(head)
    Note over VM: query emits, debounce 300ms waiting
    User->>BAR: types phones (within 300ms)
    BAR->>VM: onQueryChanged(headphones)
    Note over VM: debounce resets, only headphones survives
    Note over VM: distinctUntilChanged passes, flatMapLatest cancels prior inner flow
    VM->>VM: emit Loading
    VM->>UC: invoke(headphones)
    UC->>REPO: search(headphones)
    REPO->>API: GET /search/products?q=headphones (IO)
    API-->>REPO: List of ProductDto
    REPO-->>UC: Outcome.Success(List of Product)
    UC-->>VM: Outcome.Success
    VM-->>BAR: emit Results(list) / Empty
    BAR-->>User: renders results
